_:n2310ddb3cbc14762a79ca19ea8edb924b38 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "\nSimilarly to `po:Inline`, elements following the `po:Milestone` pattern can only be contained within block or inline elements (and consequently they also cannot be used as root elements of documents).\n\nThe distinctive characteristic of the pattern `po:Milestone` is the location it assumes within the document.\n    "@en .
